WEBVTT

00:00.360 --> 00:00.800
The city's grain

00:00.880 --> 00:02.160
How are the reserves?

00:02.240 --> 00:02.760
Yiyang

00:02.840 --> 00:04.160
Is originally a strategic stronghold

00:04.240 --> 00:04.880
The granaries

00:04.960 --> 00:05.640
Can supply the entire city's military and civilians

00:05.720 --> 00:08.053
For a year or more without problem

00:08.480 --> 00:08.920
I have ordered people

00:09.000 --> 00:10.000
To move all supplies

00:10.080 --> 00:11.240
To

00:11.320 --> 00:12.720
The southern warehouse

